          "en": "Any Person who deliberately and without right distributes and/or transmits and/or makes accessible Electronic Information and/or Electronic Documents containing content that offends decency as referred to in Article 27 paragraph (1) shall be punished with imprisonment for a maximum of 6 (six) years and/or a fine of at most Rp1,000,000,000.00 (one billion rupiah).\n\nAny Person who deliberately and without right disseminates false and misleading news that causes loss to consumers in Electronic Transactions as referred to in Article 28 paragraph (1) shall be punished with imprisonment for a maximum of 6 (six) years and/or a fine of at most Rp1,000,000,000.00 (one billion rupiah)."
